{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type HandleSubmitFn<TFormData> = () => Promise<FormValidationError<TFormData>[]>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L599","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:599"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runs submission validation and submits current values when validation\nsucceeds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Registered fields are marked touched, field validators run before form\nvalidators, and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" is awaited only when validation succeeds.\nValidation error results and errors returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" through\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createValidationError"},{"type":"text","value":" are stored as error state. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmitInvalid"},{"type":"text","value":" is\nawaited after a failed attempt."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Calls made while an attempt is in progress return the same promise instead\nof starting another attempt."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"FormValidationError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormValidationError"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":">[]>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise resolving to the error results produced by field and\nform validation, plus any validation error returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":" through\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createValidationError"},{"type":"text","value":". The array is empty if none are produced."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype HandleSubmitFn<TFormData> = () => Promise<FormValidationError<TFormData>[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:599](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L599)\n\nRuns submission validation and submits current values when validation\nsucceeds.\n\nRegistered fields are marked touched, field validators run before form\nvalidators, and `onSubmit` is awaited only when validation succeeds.\nValidation error results and errors returned by `onSubmit` through\n`createValidationError` are stored as error state. `onSubmitInvalid` is\nawaited after a failed attempt.\n\nCalls made while an attempt is in progress return the same promise instead\nof starting another attempt.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`FormValidationError`](FormValidationError.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>[]\\>\n\nA promise resolving to the error results produced by field and\nform validation, plus any validation error returned by `onSubmit` through\n`createValidationError`. The array is empty if none are produced.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HandleSubmitFn\ntitle: HandleSubmitFn\n---\n\n```ts\ntype HandleSubmitFn<TFormData> = () => Promise<FormValidationError<TFormData>[]>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:599](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L599)\n\nRuns submission validation and submits current values when validation\nsucceeds.\n\nRegistered fields are marked touched, field validators run before form\nvalidators, and `onSubmit` is awaited only when validation succeeds.\nValidation error results and errors returned by `onSubmit` through\n`createValidationError` are stored as error state. `onSubmitInvalid` is\nawaited after a failed attempt.\n\nCalls made while an attempt is in progress return the same promise instead\nof starting another attempt.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`FormValidationError`](FormValidationError.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>[]\\>\n\nA promise resolving to the error results produced by field and\nform validation, plus any validation error returned by `onSubmit` through\n`createValidationError`. The array is empty if none are produced.\n"}
